$ -------------------------------------------------------
$ FCC4 (4-SUBLATTICE ORDERED FCC, L12/L10)
$ Order-disorder: Gm = G_dis(A1) + delta_G_ord(FCC4)
$ Symmetry constraints from Eq.(10)-(11) of paper
$ -------------------------------------------------------

$ Fe-Ni sub-system (Cacciamani-Dinsdale [16])
